  "revisions": [
    {
      "workOrder": "M5-WO4",
      "change": "Post-WO3 canon amendment: M5-SC-034 RESOLVED_BY_DESIGNER (Sprint Allowance = Movement x 4, each Sprint independently); Move / Sprint read the MOVEMENT statistic (no Total Movement); CREATURE_SIZE.movementAdjustment renamed baseMovement (null: M5-SC-033 Base Movement values by Creature Size remain unresolved)."
    },
    {
      "workOrder": "M5-WO4 canon rulings",
      "change": "M5-SC-033 RESOLVED_BY_DESIGNER: CREATURE_SIZE.baseMovement Small 5 ft, Medium 5 ft, Large 10 ft, Huge 15 ft (Movement = Base Movement x AGI). Massive stays null pending canon (new M5-SC-036). Occupied space is still never read as Base Movement."
    }
  ]
